# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the disaggregation step-1 window (docs/tp4-disagg-step1.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/disagg and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are
# resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ONE IMAGE: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1 (tp4-octo2-1 carries the same
# stack: sed -i 's/tp4-next2-1/tp4-octo2-1/' *.env if that is the one on the rig). No new code, no build: every profile and test here is already in both images.
# X0: the card state before the window: status, a rescan of the topology, an all-four reset (links train only at board init, so the pair job D2 runs straight after it).
# READ: four cards present and healthy, no other window driver alive. Stop rule: anything else. Duration (estimate): 20 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status rescan reset
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-next2-1
